@fg-lab/amadeus-state README · Install and configure：Install the prebuilt `.tgz` with the official DSH plugin manager into your selected Profile. No local source build is required. Follow [installation instructions](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md); do not copy configuration into a running Profile by hand.

Use native DSH settings to choose a Workspace and inspect state and evolution rules.

The other Amadeus plugins are optional. Install only the integrations you need.

@fg-lab/amadeus-state README · 安装与首次配置：使用官方 DSH 插件管理器将预构建 `.tgz` 安装到所需 Profile，无需手工构建源码。按[安装说明](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md)操作，不要手工改写正在运行的 Profile。

在 DSH 原生设置中选择工作区，查看状态并配置演化规则。

其他 Amadeus 插件均为可选联动，按需要分别安装。
